      en: ["Salt production at Atanasovsko Lake has been continuous since 1906.", "The lake hosts 316 of the 426 bird species found in all of Bulgaria.", "The average depth of the lake is only about 30 centimeters.", "The northern section was designated a Ramsar site of importance in 1984.", "Brine shrimp (Artemia salina) provide a primary food source for many birds.", "Public mud and lye baths were modernized for tourists in the 2010s."],
